abstract: "Arduino library for the Okapi ATmega1284p-based data logger. Manages
  logging, power, telemetry, and on-board sensing, with support for solar charging,
  Particle Boron telemetry, external interrupt counting, RTC-driven sleep/wake
  cycles, and SD-card data logging."
